  <h2>4. Your server is your responsibility</h2>
  <p>
    RCON is full administrative control of a game server. The App sends the commands you type,
    exactly as you type them, to the server you pointed it at. A command can restart the match,
    change the map, remove players, or change any setting the server exposes — and it takes effect
    immediately, for everyone connected.
  </p>
  <p>You are responsible for:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>
